t h8=Q unless they can capture on h7, but their king is too far (c8) and no other pieces can reach it. This will almost certainly lead to a queen.\n\nReason: Promoting a pawn to a queen is the fastest way to secure a win in this endgame-like position. The h6-h7 advance puts maximum pressure with minimal resistance.\n\nAnswer: P: h6-h7"}
