e.\n\nReason: The strongest move is Q: c6-d5 because it checks the Black king immediately, exploits its lack of cover, and maximizes pressure. It forces Black into a defensive position and may lead to rapid loss of the king or material. Delaying this check risks allowing Black to improve their king position.\n\nAnswer: Q: c6-d5"}
